1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,419
Step three, smelting, in a water jacketed blast furnace with coke and sand.

2
00:00:06,419 --> 00:00:08,554
Silica is the flux.

3
00:00:08,554 --> 00:00:13,072
It carries the iron away as a fusible slag of iron silicate.

4
00:00:13,072 --> 00:00:17,265
Any copper oxide is turned back into sulphide by the iron sulphide.

5
00:00:17,265 --> 00:00:25,625
What collects below the slag is copper matte, a melt of copper and iron sulphides, about forty five percent copper.

